316	     * Whether this owner has been soft-deleted. A {@code DELETE /api/owners/{id}} sets this true and
317	     * retains the record rather than removing it; a newly created owner is false. Soft-deleted owners
318	     * are still returned by {@code GET /api/owners/{id}} but are ignored by the create endpoint's
319	     * duplicate/identity checks (see {@code CheckIdentityUnique}).
